Package: OrnTx
Title: Expression Atlas for Ornamental Plant Transcriptomics
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lashika", "Meena",
           email = "lashikakarnal@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000")))
Author: Lashika Meena [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Lashika Meena <lashikakarnal@gmail.com>
Description: The first R/Bioconductor package for ornamental plant
    transcriptomics. Provides a complete RNA-seq pipeline (download,
    QC, alignment, import), a curated 270-sample Rosa chinensis
    expression atlas, a 64-gene floriculture trait database anchored
    to Arabidopsis orthologs, multi-tool import support (STAR,
    featureCounts, HTSeq, Salmon), auto-detection of three Rosa
    chinensis gene ID formats (STAR gene0, RchiOBHm locus names,
    NCBI LOC IDs), and cross-species validation on Tagetes erecta.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/lashikakarnal/OrnTx
BugReports: https://github.com/lashikakarnal/OrnTx/issues
